# The deepest nesting from the location tree: the contents of its first
# location, the office, item 1 there, its Loans tab, a new loan form and
# the help of that form.  Each list on the way is paged to its end and
# back first (End, Home), so that it holds its ring of page cursors.
#@ DEEP
# T_SCRE's SCRE34 runs the same nesting; here it runs in the whole INV,
# which links every screen, with the free memory T_SCR.SH -m sets.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END HOME ENTER END HOME ENTER ALT-C A END HOME INS ENTER F1
S DEEPHELP
K ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
